Error [jet.InvalidMarkerGroupMember]: This member cannot be stored in a named marker group.
  --> tests/ui/marker_group_forbidden.jet:4:18
    |
  4 |         group: #[Unsafe("audit"), Inline]
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A group contains only active, fixed marker applications; gates, refusals, retired markers and other groups must not be hidden in it.
 Fix: Remove this member from the group and write gates or refusals explicitly at each use site.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0400
